{"content_hash": "c4eade0c77b299d0", "version_id": 872, "article_id": 88, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Storage Hunter Simulator comes to PS5 and Xbox on November 24", "title_zh": "《仓库猎人模拟器》11月24日登陆PS5和Xbox", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/221947", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606813907291-d86efa9b94db?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8cGxheXN0YXRpb24lMjB4Ym94JTIwc2VyaWVzfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM4NDI2NTl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Charles Sims on Unsplash", "author": "Charles Sims", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@1charlessims?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/white-and-black-box-on-white-table-QHha7JOJYnw?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(255, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(293, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "fcb7069c8333"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-05", "word_count": 138, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "A new game about buying old storage units is coming to consoles. Players will bid on items and try to find treasure.", "lead_zh": "一款关于购买旧仓库的新游戏即将登陆主机平台。玩家将参与竞拍，寻找宝藏。", "preview": "Storage Hunter Simulator will launch on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026. It costs $24.99. Players go to auctions in d", "preview_zh": "《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。玩家前往不同城镇的拍卖会，与其他竞拍者争夺车库、储物间和集装箱。每场拍卖都可能藏着惊喜。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 855, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 53.1, "size_bytes": 319536, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 162, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 54.325, "size_bytes": 326880, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 162, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 58.825, "size_bytes": 353952, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 162, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 50.2, "size_bytes": 302112, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 162, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 53.6, "size_bytes": 322560, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 162, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@cf016b9/content/data/versions/872.json", "paragraphs": ["Storage Hunter Simulator will launch on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026. It costs $24.99. Players go to auctions in different towns. They compete with other bidders for garages, storage rooms, and containers. Every auction may hide a surprise.", "The game has thousands of unique items to find. Players can ask experts to check an item's value. As the business grows, they unlock tools to judge value themselves. They can buy a pawn shop and hire staff. They can also drive seven vehicles and manage fuel.", "Players can play alone or with up to three friends. Friends can join or leave at any time. The team shares one bank account, so they must plan together. There is also a No Refunds Edition for $34.99. It includes an expansion pass with five themed DLC packs."], "paragraphs_zh": ["《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。玩家前往不同城镇的拍卖会，与其他竞拍者争夺车库、储物间和集装箱。每场拍卖都可能藏着惊喜。", "游戏中有数千种独特物品等待发现。玩家可以请专家鉴定物品价值。随着生意发展，玩家会解锁自行估价的工具。他们可以购买典当行并雇用员工，还能驾驶七种载具并管理燃油。", "玩家可以独自游玩，也可以与最多三位好友合作。好友可以随时加入或退出。团队共用一个银行账户，因此必须一起商量计划。此外还有售价34.99美元的“概不退款版”，包含扩展通行证和五个主题DLC包。"], "body": "Storage Hunter Simulator will launch on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026. It costs $24.99. Players go to auctions in different towns. They compete with other bidders for garages, storage rooms, and containers. Every auction may hide a surprise.\n\nThe game has thousands of unique items to find. Players can ask experts to check an item's value. As the business grows, they unlock tools to judge value themselves. They can buy a pawn shop and hire staff. They can also drive seven vehicles and manage fuel.\n\nPlayers can play alone or with up to three friends. Friends can join or leave at any time. The team shares one bank account, so they must plan together. There is also a No Refunds Edition for $34.99. It includes an expansion pass with five themed DLC packs.", "body_zh": "《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。玩家前往不同城镇的拍卖会，与其他竞拍者争夺车库、储物间和集装箱。每场拍卖都可能藏着惊喜。\n\n游戏中有数千种独特物品等待发现。玩家可以请专家鉴定物品价值。随着生意发展，玩家会解锁自行估价的工具。他们可以购买典当行并雇用员工，还能驾驶七种载具并管理燃油。\n\n玩家可以独自游玩，也可以与最多三位好友合作。好友可以随时加入或退出。团队共用一个银行账户，因此必须一起商量计划。此外还有售价34.99美元的“概不退款版”，包含扩展通行证和五个主题DLC包。", "text": "Storage Hunter Simulator will launch on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026. It costs $24.99. Players go to auctions in different towns. They compete with other bidders for garages, storage rooms, and containers. Every auction may hide a surprise. The game has thousands of unique items to find. Players can ask experts to check an item's value. As the business grows, they unlock tools to judge value themselves. They can buy a pawn shop and hire staff. They can also drive seven vehicles and manage fuel. Players can play alone or with up to three friends. Friends can join or leave at any time. The team shares one bank account, so they must plan together. There is also a No Refunds Edition for $34.99. It includes an expansion pass with five themed DLC packs.", "vocab": [{"word": "auction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "拍卖", "note": "常见搭配：go to an auction（去拍卖会）", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bidder", "pos": "noun", "zh": "竞拍者", "note": "动词是 bid（出价）", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "storage", "pos": "noun", "zh": "仓库；储物间", "note": "storage room 指储物间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；上市", "note": "常用于游戏、产品上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "compete", "pos": "verb", "zh": "竞争", "note": "compete with 与……竞争", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unique", "pos": "adj", "zh": "独特的", "note": "强调与众不同", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expert", "pos": "noun", "zh": "专家", "note": "ask an expert 请教专家", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pawn shop", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "典当行", "note": "经营类游戏常见地点", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-05T01:37:37.647708", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Storage", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.675, "sm": 275, "em": 675, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Hunter", "s": 0.675, "e": 1.0, "sm": 675, "em": 999, "cs": 8, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Simulator", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.575, "sm": 1000, "em": 1575, "cs": 15, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "will", "s": 1.575, "e": 1.75, "sm": 1575, "em": 1750, "cs": 25, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "launch", "s": 1.75, "e": 2.087, "sm": 1750, "em": 2087, "cs": 30, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "on", "s": 2.087, "e": 2.2, "sm": 2087, "em": 2199, "cs": 37, "ce": 39, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "PlayStation", "s": 2.2, "e": 2.85, "sm": 2200, "em": 2849, "cs": 40, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "5", "s": 2.85, "e": 3.312, "sm": 2850, "em": 3312, "cs": 52, "ce": 53, "si"